#: bal/gui/qt/window.py:1196
msgid "Percentage: a share of the wallet balance (e.g. 30). The heirs' percentages are weights: together they share, in proportion, what is left after the fees and the fixed amounts (e.g. two heirs at 30 and no others: half each). Fixed amount: an exact amount in the wallet's unit, paid first. If no heir has a percentage, what is left over is shared among the heirs with a fixed amount, in proportion: the wallet is always emptied completely."
